        "type": "game",
        "name": "The Dark Legacy",
        "steam_appid": 3679470,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.poster.avif?t=1787697077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.webm?t=1787697077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in a decayed mansion and an abandoned hospital where the state once conducted secret experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a renowned brain surgeon, <strong>Dr. Victor Halberg</strong> lost touch with reality after the sudden death of his wife, turning his mansion into a dark laboratory. His obsessions and tragedy unearthed not only family secrets but also hidden government projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are his estranged grandson, <strong>John Halberg</strong>. Drowning in debt, you return to sell the inherited estate. But behind the walls lies more than decay… a legacy that should have remained forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, the house awakens. And the deeper you descend, the shadows of the past drag you into a hospital the state tried to erase. There you will find not only traces of experiments, but echoes of screams on the edge of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.poster.avif?t=1787697077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.webm?t=1787697077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Gameplay</strong><br><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a survival horror focused on exploration and tension.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mansion:</strong> Investigate secret rooms, gather notes and recordings, uncover family secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospital:</strong> Follow the trail of state experiments, explore hidden laboratories, reveal buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Operate old machines, solve codes, navigate the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Every sound, shadow, and step brings you closer to forgotten fragments of the past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door hides a secret. Every room holds a deeper fear. And when the truth surfaces, you’ll realize some questions are safer unanswered.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.poster.avif?t=1787697077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/4076e1741dc930c743fd7a484b80c0a2.webm?t=1787697077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a first-person psychological horror set in a decayed mansion and an abandoned hospital where the state once conducted secret experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a renowned brain surgeon, <strong>Dr. Victor Halberg</strong> lost touch with reality after the sudden death of his wife, turning his mansion into a dark laboratory. His obsessions and tragedy unearthed not only family secrets but also hidden government projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are his estranged grandson, <strong>John Halberg</strong>. Drowning in debt, you return to sell the inherited estate. But behind the walls lies more than decay… a legacy that should have remained forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, the house awakens. And the deeper you descend, the shadows of the past drag you into a hospital the state tried to erase. There you will find not only traces of experiments, but echoes of screams on the edge of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.poster.avif?t=1787697077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679470/extras/a3ade709c37ba20963fc3404f4d1ccd3.webm?t=1787697077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Gameplay</strong><br><strong>The Dark Legacy</strong> is a survival horror focused on exploration and tension.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mansion:</strong> Investigate secret rooms, gather notes and recordings, uncover family secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospital:</strong> Follow the trail of state experiments, explore hidden laboratories, reveal buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Operate old machines, solve codes, navigate the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Every sound, shadow, and step brings you closer to forgotten fragments of the past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door hides a secret. Every room holds a deeper fear. And when the truth surfaces, you’ll realize some questions are safer unanswered.</p>",
        "short_description": "The Dark Legacy is a first-person psychological horror that takes you from a decayed mansion to a secret state hospital. Every room whispers with shadows, and some truths are safer left forgotten.",
